      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom semi-detached, turn-key residence to the market, ideally located at No. 1 Seskin View Avenue, Tallaght, Dublin 24.\nThis superb property was fully renovated in 2020 and has been meticulously maintained since, offering bright, contemporary and beautifully balanced accommodation throughout.\nInternal accommodation of c.86 sqm comprises a welcoming entrance porch leading to a hallway, a generous living room to the front, a stylish kitchen/dining space to the rear and a convenient downstairs toilet. Upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main family bathroom.\nTo the rear lies a sunny west-facing garden, providing a private and inviting setting perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining.\nSeskin View is a mature and well-established development, ideally positioned close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, sports facilities, and excellent public transport links, with easy access to major road networks.\nThis outstanding, move-in-ready home is sure to appeal to a broad range of buyers including first-time purchasers and families alike. Early viewing is highly recommended — contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n- c. 86 sq m\n- 3 bed, 1 bath\n- Semi-detached\n- Fully stripped & renovated in 2020 including re-wiring, plumbing, insulation\n- New windows & doors installed 2020\n- New combi boiler installed 2020\n- Turn key\n- Truly stunning family home\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Low maintenance landscaped west facing rear garden\n- Driveway to the front\n- Early viewing highly advised!\n\nBER Details\nBER: C2\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 KVP6"
      },
      {
